utoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686320/extras/f31552daf7bfc030548a9d3f3a9c54ca.poster.avif?t=1755250055\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686320/extras/f31552daf7bfc030548a9d3f3a9c54ca.webm?t=1755250055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686320/extras/f31552daf7bfc030548a9d3f3a9c54ca.mp4?t=1755250055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imperial Chopper isn\u2019t famous for its food, or strict regulations, or\u2026 Hey, speak of the devil! First officer, care to explain your frivolous looks? Don\u2019t even try to hide behind a wrench, you\u2019ll still be punished and assigned to community work! Now go polish some barrels! \u200b\u200bLieutenant, where are you heading with this huge missile? And why is it so\u2026 slick? Wait, is it a lubricant?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phew, whatever. Trust me, commander, sir, this place is reserved for best of the best! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686320/extras/14d2e51864a3f0bc58db8367368005a0.poster.avif?t=1755250055\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686320/extras/14d2e51864a3f0bc58db8367368005a0.webm?t=1755250055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686320/extras/14d2e51864a3f0bc58db8367368005a0.mp4?t=1755250055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f 9 levels loaded with sex and shooting </p><p class=\